  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Accelerating Circular Economy  innovation for food, climate and Health in Cape Town. This project will be implemented by ICLEI Africa  which is  a leading global network of over 1,750 cities , towns and regions committed to building a sustainable urban future .The project will accelerate circularity innovation through two strategic approaches by supporting the city in creating an enabling policy environment for innovation as well as acceleration support to local start up companies.</narrative>
